            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osmotic 帮助"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Osmotic asks GitHub (api.github.com) for the latest release; nothing about you or your camera is sent. Updates are installed only when their signature matches the key built into this app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osmotic le pregunta a GitHub (api.github.com) por la última versión; no se manda nada sobre vos ni tu cámara. Las actualizaciones se instalan solo si su firma coincide con la clave incluida en la app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osmotic 向 GitHub（api.github.com）查询最新版本，不会发送你或相机的信息。只有更新签名与应用内置密钥匹配时才会安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Osmotic doesn’t have Bluetooth permission. Turn it on in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Bluetooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
