    "That disk has no DCIM folder, so there is nothing from a camera on it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ese disco no tiene carpeta DCIM, así que no hay nada de una cámara ahí."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此磁盘没有 DCIM 文件夹，未找到相机素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac’s Bluetooth is off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El Bluetooth de la Mac está apagado."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 的蓝牙已关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cable negotiated %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El cable negoció %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数据线协商规格：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera closed the Bluetooth connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara cerró la conexión Bluetooth."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机已关闭蓝牙连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t accept the command. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no aceptó el comando. Probá de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未接受指令。请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t answer on the data link. If macOS asked about local network access, allow it and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no respondió en el enlace de datos. Si macOS preguntó por acceso a la red local, permitilo y reintentá."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未响应数据连接。如 macOS 询问本地网络权限，请允许后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t change mode. Try again, or change it on the camera.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no cambió de modo. Probá de nuevo o cambialo en la cámara."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未切换模式。请重试，或在相机上手动切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t hand over its Wi-Fi. Try turning it off and on again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no entregó su Wi-Fi. Probá apagarla y encenderla."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未提供 Wi-Fi 信息。请将相机关机后重新开机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t send it over Bluetooth. It’s on the camera’s screen: Settings › Wireless connection (network %@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no la envió por Bluetooth. Está en su pantalla: Ajustes › Conexión inalámbrica (red %@)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未通过蓝牙发送密码。可在相机屏幕的“设置 › 无线连接”中查看（网络 %@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera didn’t switch to capture mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La cámara no pasó a modo captura."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "相机未切换到拍摄模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera's card, over the cable. No Wi-Fi, and your Internet stays on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tarjeta de la cámara, por cable. Sin Wi-Fi, y no perdés Internet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过数据线读取相机存储卡。无需 Wi-Fi，不影响上网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera’s card": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
